    "body": "S008 strengthens mathematical assurance and closes two cyclic-family gaps while universal critical ASH* remains open for stacking and clearing. The hostile audit retains S007 Lemmas28/29/31 and Theorem30 at their stated scopes; Corollary32 was an upper only, and Theorem33 remains explicitly conditional.\n\nThe session proves exact triangle-tail stacking `4*2^l` for every `l>=0`, using a complete all-final-root ancestry lower for the AS tip pile with two core singletons. It also proves that a triangle with `k>=1` leaves attached at one vertex has stacking threshold `3k+5` and clearing threshold `3k+7`, with separate all-distribution legal uppers and AS weight/chronology obstructions. Full proofs, quantifiers, dependencies and universal research failures/obligations are in the S008 report and AUDIT. Novelty is unaudited; these families do not pass the universal mathematical gate.\n\nValidation: fresh S006/S007 independent dependency checks; nine exact named-buffer tree/forest certificates with 774 forest witnesses; candidate complete closures for tail lengths0..3; 4376 universally nonnegative symbolic production inequalities; 72 complete labelled branch layers/127799 configurations and 36173 constructive traces/479591 legal moves, independently checked. Current and inherited governance/hashes pass. Administrative text/hash/whitespace failures and corrections are retained; historical snapshots preserve original bytes.\n\nAll mirrors and closeout are updated. The complete S009 prompt begins with deep primary-source prior-art/originality/dependency investigation, then sustained universal ASH* research. S009 is FUTURE/UNEXECUTED. No Lean, Palomar, manuscript, arXiv, journal or correspondence; no intermediate-result publication programme.\n\nIntegration pin: one atomic authored S008 head `8fe4ec3e09fcee3a80f6f0caa9eb97337f9ee061`, tree `902a6b524667d9fb3690102faf8e867da350af4c`, parent/base `3f2aba35da0ac48b7d93ef0df7d84af5ef2475b4`. Hosted S008 jobs and eventual ordinary two-parent merge will be recorded here only after actual verification. No separate human review or kernel certification is claimed.\n\nVerified integration: PR head workflow [38605528753](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38605528753) completed success, all five actual jobs and all five check-runs successful. No human reviews were submitted; zero legacy status contexts do not imply success. Ordinary merge `325f39d3448b6a0dfa092ea16196c56c3cc04673`, parents `3f2aba35da0ac48b7d93ef0df7d84af5ef2475b4` / `8fe4ec3e09fcee3a80f6f0caa9eb97337f9ee061`, tree identical to authored head `902a6b524667d9fb3690102faf8e867da350af4c`. Live remote main and local clean main match; remote STATE and S009 prompt reread byte-for-byte. Main push workflow [38606309819](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38606309819) completed success with five actual jobs and five check-runs, independently reread. Final remote/local main remain at the verified merge with a clean worktree. S008 integration COMPLETE; S009 remains FUTURE/UNEXECUTED.\n\n| Actual job | PR head job (success) | Main merge job (success) |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| s005-replay (0) | 115995290617 | 115997992241 |\n| s005-replay (1) | 115995290549 | 115997992485 |\n| s005-replay (2) | 115995290777 | 115997993024 |\n| s005-replay (3) | 115995290493 | 115997992412 |\n| validate | 115995290228 | 115997991911 |\n",
